P actions make_etude
P memjob 3072000
P memory_limit 3000.0
P mode interactif
P nomjob AsterThermalEigenValues
P version stable
A args -max_base 300000
A memjeveux 1024.0
A tpmax 20000.0
F comm AsterThermalEigenValuesparam.in D  1
F comm AsterThermalEigenValues.comm D  1
F libr AsterThermalEigenValuesinput.med D  20
F rmed AsterThermalEigenValuesoutput.rmed R  80
F mess AsterThermalEigenValues.log R  6
F libr AsterThermalEigenValues_objective.csv R  27
